---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy for (K)Need.">
  <main class="wf-container py-page">
    <div class="wf-page-head">
      <div class="wf-eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="wf-page-h1">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="wf-page-intro">Last updated January 2025.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="simple-body">
      <p>This Privacy Policy explains how (K)Need ("we", "us", "our") collects, uses and protects information about you when you use our website at kneed.tv.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--parchment); font-weight:500;">Information we collect.</strong> We collect information you provide directly, such as your name and email address when you submit a bakery or sign up to our newsletter. We also collect usage data automatically through Google Analytics and Meta Pixel, including pages visited, time on site and general location.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--parchment); font-weight:500;">How we use it.</strong> We use your information to respond to submissions, send newsletters you have opted into, and improve the website. We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--parchment); font-weight:500;">Cookies.</strong> We use cookies for analytics and to remember your preferences such as dark or light mode. See our <a href="/cookies" style="color:var(--amber);">Cookie Policy</a> for more detail.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--parchment); font-weight:500;">Third party services.</strong> We use Google Analytics, Meta Pixel and Cloudflare Pages. Each has their own privacy policy.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--parchment); font-weight:500;">Your rights.</strong> You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information at any time by contacting us at hello@kneed.tv.</p>
      <p><strong style="color:var(--parchment); font-weight:500;">Contact.</strong> For any privacy questions, email us at hello@kneed.tv.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>